# Turned around on the street, the rider looks across the road at the land in
# front of it, and builds there: on the street's twin (s0'), which runs the
# other way along the same road, so its lots are the land in front of s0.
new village
stock wood=40 stone=40 planks=20
ride s0:100
turn around
expect rider s0'
build house here
run until built
list
map B90:-H125
# roads and crossroads are laid from the street's own side
expect cannot build crossroads at s0':170 turn around
# and back
turn around
expect rider s0
reload
expect at s0':292 house done
